["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isni", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[International Standard Name Identifier (ISNI)](https://isni.org/page/what-is-isni/) is a unique identifier used to distinguish the public identities of parties involved in the creation, production, and distribution of media content. Standardized by [ISO 27729](https://www.iso.org/standard/87177.html), it consists of 16 characters\u201415 digits plus a final check character\u2014and is often represented as a URI, such as `https://isni.org/isni/000000012146438X`.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:Naf2e2f257ccb4b8a87441960334562d5", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Literal", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/SbomType/deployed", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "SBOM provides an inventory of software that is present on a system. This may be an assembly of other SBOMs that combines analysis of configuration options, and examination of execution behavior in a (potentially simulated) deployment environment.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/countyCode", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/webpage", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "A Uniform Resource Locator (URL) that can be used to locate a resource, as defined in [RFC 9110](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc9110/) Section 4.2.1 or Section 4.2.2. It may include an optional fragment identifier as specified in [RFC 3986](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc3986) Section 3.5.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/hsCodes", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType", "globalId", "", ""]
